	Digital Unix 4.0b needs a bigger root disk.  Your first step in the upgrade 3.2b->3.2c->3.2g->4.0a->4.0b (yes I believe you have to do all these steps) should be to increase the size of your root partition.  I have been stealing 60Mbytes from my primary swap partition and giving it to my root partition.  This make the root ~120 MB.   

