> OSF/1 v 3.0.  Here is the script itself: @(#)local.profile setup
> #
> if ["`basename ${SHELL}`"=="ksh"]; export ENV=${HOME}./kshrc fi

There are at least 5 errors in that line, and more in the rest of the
script. You need to test it carefully both on the Sun system and the OSF
one.

if [ "`basename ${SHELL}`" = "ksh" ]; then export ENV=${HOME}./kshrc ;
fi

will sort out line 3. Note the addition of white space, the replacement
of == by =, the addition of 'then' and a semi-colon before the 'fi'.

Bob
