> Is it possible to add multiple default routes into the IP 
> routing table for OSF/1 v 3.x?

Not in the conventional sense of "default route", but sorta.

You can use gated to speak to the routers with OSPF or some other sort of
IGP, in which case you can utilize multiple routers in an intelligent
manner.  Short of using some routing protocol to populate your routing
