blank then expose events for all fields except those already written and the
text writes to all exposed fields.    Software people are saying to me that
this must be an O/S fault and it could not be in the app or in the athena
widget library.   I have included below the xmon listings for the same
window when it comes up ok, and then when it comes up incorrectly.  

Any ideas suggestions help would be appreciated.
