<p>Stevens, W. Richard, Unix Network Programming,Prentice Hall, ISBN
0-13-949876-1<nl>
Curry, David A.,Unix Systems Programming for SVR4, O'Reilly, ISBN
1-565592-163-1<nl>
</p>
